      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Grüü",
            unit: "Grüü",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "scout",
            kill: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("When the party finally reached Barag Gór, they were met with a most startling sight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 22,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("What the—! Barag Gór is besieged by elves! The wose-born weaklings have always been jealous of our power, but what reason do they have to attack the city?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grüü",
            text: _("What can you expect, Chief? They’re elves after all."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Hmmm. $scout.name, go find out what they are up to."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Scout",
            text: _("Sure."),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "scout.x",
            value: 32,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "scout.y",
            value: 6,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "u_26",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "scout",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ammon",
            text: _("One more step and you are dead, flea-bag. Better run if you value your life."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Scout",
            text: _("Quit your boasting, mule-ears. The Chief wants to know why you’re here, instead of cowering in your dung-spattered forests."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ammon",
            text: _("Watch your mouth around your betters, goblin! And you can tell your chief to hand the shamans over to us if he wants to be alive by sundown."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Scout",
            text: _("What business do you high-and-mighty elves have with our shamans?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ammon",
            text: _("Our business with them is none of your concern."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Scout",
            text: _("Oh, yes, it is. The shamans keep our ancient knowledge and our sacred things; they are not for the likes of you. Why do you want them anyway?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ammon",
            text: _("Well... the humans want to... meet with them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Scout",
            text: _("Oh, so they paid you to come and get them, have they?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ammon",
            text: _("Well..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Scout",
            text: _("So the ‘great and mighty’ elves are now nothing but a bunch of mercenaries."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ammon",
            text: _("KILL HIM!!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_27",
            type: "Elvish Fighter",
            side: 5,
            x: 28,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_27",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_28",
            type: "Elvish Fighter",
            side: 5,
            x: 28,
            y: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_28",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Scout",
            text: _("Hahaha! If you can!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "scout.x",
            value: 36,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "scout.y",
            value: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "u_26",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "scout",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ammon",
            text: _("Blast it, he got away."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("So, what news do you bring, $scout.name?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Scout",
            text: _("The elves have been bribed by the humans to capture and deliver the shamans to them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Over my dead body! The shamans of the Great Council are the only people who can call up the Great Horde. If they are captured, then all the orcs on this continent would surely be doomed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grüü",
            text: _("I have a subtle plan, Chief."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Go on, Grüü."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grüü",
            text: _("We go and we kill all of them. What do you think?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: "1,3",
            x: 6,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 7,
            y: 30,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Jetto",
            type: "Orcish Slayer",
            side: 1,
            x: 6,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Jetto",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Jetto",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Orcish Assassin",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jetto",
            text: _("Freedom! Many thanks, Son of the Black-Eye. I’m Jetto, master of assassins, now you can count on the assassins’ guild to help you in your quest!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Jetto, how did you get captured by the likes of these?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Jetto",
            text: _("The Barag Gór Council sent me to assassinate the elvish leaders. Unfortunately, I was captured. But now I am free and the elves shall feel my wrath!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "freed_Jetto",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_12",
        on: "branch_if_12",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "freed_Jetto",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 6,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/jetto.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("Son of the Black-Eye! Could I ask for my release from this blighted cage?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("How did you get captured by the likes of these?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 6,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/jetto.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("The Barag Gór Council sent me to assassinate the elvish leaders. Unfortunately, I was captured."),
